WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.199 --> 00:00:04.040
SCP-173 Vs SCP-049.

00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:06.089
The Sculpture Vs The Plague Doctor.

00:00:06.089 --> 00:00:07.089
Who would win?

00:00:07.089 --> 00:00:11.420
The Plague Doctor kills with a touch, but
173 doesn’t seem to be alive in the traditional

00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:12.440
sense at all.

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:15.740
So, could 049 technically kill 173?

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:20.470
Outside of 049’s touch of death, he has
no real combat skills it could leverage against

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:21.470
173.

00:00:21.470 --> 00:00:26.920
049 is also capable of sleep, implying it
likely has eyelids, making it vulnerable to

00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:28.060
173.

00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:32.500
And we all know what happens if you even so
much as blink when looking at 173.

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:38.930
If you are unfamiliar, then this next point
is for you: SCP-049 also has a neck.

00:00:38.930 --> 00:00:41.760
And well...simply put...Blink?...then SNAP!

00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:47.600
Personally, we think that SCP-173 and it’s
spine-splintering desires is the clear victor

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:48.149
here.

